## 3. System Requirements

- Python 3.12+
- SQLite 3.35+ with FTS5 compiled in (verify: `python3 -c "import sqlite3; c=sqlite3.connect(':memory:'); c.execute('CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE t USING fts5(x)')"`)
- A local OpenAI-compatible LLM API (llama.cpp, Ollama, etc.) — used for entity extraction and optional reranking. Model is auto-detected from `/v1/models`.
- Internet access on first run only (fastembed downloads the embedding model, ~130 MB, on first use and caches it)
- OpenClaw gateway (for skill registration and cron jobs)

