## 14. Acceptance Criteria

| Criterion | Target | How to verify |
|---|---|---|
| Search latency | <500ms per query | `time .venv/bin/python memory.py search "test"` |
| Search quality | Relevant result in top 3 for known past decisions | Manual spot checks |
| Indexing | All memory files indexed | `memory.py stats` shows correct file count |
| Entity extraction | Graph populated after nightly run | `memory.py stats` shows nodes > 0 |
| Model agnosticism | Works after model swap | Change LLM, re-run search — no config change needed |
| Decay | Old daily logs removed from index | Check stats before/after `indexer.py --decay` on old data |
| Audit log | All searches recorded | `SELECT * FROM audit_log ORDER BY ts DESC LIMIT 10` in SQLite |

